&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p&gt;So far in this series, we’ve covered everything from the basics of &lt;strong&gt;Sera Protocol&lt;/strong&gt; and how to use its GraphQL Subgraph to executing trades via the CLI.&lt;/p&gt;


